00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:45.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
it would then
lessen your value of it.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:46.733 line:92%
-Believe me, I would find many

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:49.669 size:84% position:42%
Marcia was left-handed,
